; Ask the sender for the parts of a long tape or bundle that haven't come.
FORM PARTS_ASK
TITLE Ask for missing parts
SUMMARY A long key tape or startup bundle comes in numbered parts. This asks the station that sent it for the parts that haven't arrived, by number.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 83
ACTION parts_request
FIELD id Waiting for(@parts_waiting) required
NEXT KEY_OPEN BUNDLE_LOAD
BEGIN_HELP
Waiting for:
Each set shows who sent it and how many parts are in. Nothing opens until every part is here, each signed by the same station. A set still short after the hold time (three days unless your box is set otherwise) is dropped, and the sender sends it again.
END
